	measure Min_30Days_CycleDuration = ```
			
			VAR MaxDate =
			    MAX ( 'fact_process_time_analyses'[date_debut] )
			VAR MinDate =
			    MaxDate - 30
			RETURN
			CALCULATE (
			    MIN ( 'fact_process_time_analyses'[mesure_value_h] ),
			    'fact_process_time_analyses'[measure_type] = "BATCH_CYCLE_DURATION",
			    REMOVEFILTERS ( 'fact_process_time_analyses'[batch_id] ),
			    FILTER (
			        ALLSELECTED ( 'fact_process_time_analyses'[date_debut] ),
			        'fact_process_time_analyses'[date_debut] >= MinDate
			            && 'fact_process_time_analyses'[date_debut] <= MaxDate
			    )
			)
			
			```
		displayFolder: Mesures\AUTRES
		lineageTag: 64c03024-2967-429a-99c7-f11b974f1e35

		annotation PBI_FormatHint = {"isGeneralNumber":true}

